abstract: >-
  A Claude Code plugin bundling a /method slash command, an auto-triggering
  methodology-driven-thinking skill, and a red-team-critic subagent over a
  shared index of 29 analytical frameworks. The design enforces that methods
  are applied explicitly (every step walked through) rather than named, with
  verify-before-assert discipline and deliberate adversarial double-pass
  review. Tuned for Claude Opus 4.8 prompting best practices.
